  "notes": "Fuselage dots measured on the right side of the A320neo (OO-SBH); the left side of the A330 OO-SFE shows the same two groups mirrored (navy dots aftmost in the forward group, foremost in the aft group), so they're drawn on both sides. Exact dot counts differ a little by type. Not drawn: 'Member of Lufthansa Group' and the registration with Belgian and EU flags aft. The fin dots are taken from the right side; that the left matches front to back is from the A330 photo at low resolution. Aircraft not yet repainted fly the 2021/2017 schemes (white with the red-dot 'b' on the fin and a dark belly band); several specials (Belgian Icons) also fly. Re-checked 2026-11-15: the dots drawn as circles (smooth); 'brussels' lowercase measured at 0.68 of its ascenders on OO-SBH.",
  "history": "Replaced Skyarium v1's approximation. The 2024 scheme succeeds the 2017/2021 'b' scheme (13 red dots forming a 'b' on the fin)."
